## Conversation
The user requested optional Mooncake Store routing with a descriptor exported from the initialized pinned vLLM connector. They then requested separate logical commits. The worker extension must remain opt-in and must not change serving behavior when optional metadata is unavailable.

## Actions
Added the explicit descriptor worker extension, named RPC publication, worker-only FPM composition, rank and descriptor validation, source fingerprint checks, initialized-connector test cases, and an offline oracle generator based on pinned coordinator definitions. The adapter targets vLLM revision 1085b64425a9e6f5ca52876ad32e55fda5665f4e. Focused worker checks passed 52 tests; 4 initialized-connector cases skipped because torch was absent. Scoped Ruff, compileall, and oracle regeneration checks passed. Validation was performed on the complete implementation rather than each intermediate commit.

