## Dead Ends
General support for arbitrary vLLM versions was rejected because the adapter depends on exact private structure and hash semantics. Public collective_rpc cannot establish all internal data-parallel engine replies with the pinned DPLBAsyncMPClient implementation, so the feature requires one DP rank per endpoint. Default deployments do not auto-install the extension or enable callable serialization.

## Hints for Future Agents
Use the named dynamo_mooncake_store_descriptor RPC with both collective timeout and asyncio.wait_for. Keep the FPM composite in the worker-only module. Export exact initialized lookup prefixes rather than rebuilding them from assumed topology. Source-pinned AST oracle execution is not initialized-engine acceptance and does not prove tensor registration, transfer, inference, or GPU behavior.

## Codebase Discoveries
Pinned DPLBAsyncMPClient.call_utility_async broadcasts internally but returns only the first result. ModelRuntimeConfig.set_engine_specific provides the needed metadata channel without new PyO3 fields. Connector getters do not establish every deployment fact about master, tenant, publisher identity, or event endpoint.

